unavailable_sensors.description:
The alarm cannot monitor every configured zone because these entities are missing, unknown, or unavailable:

{sensors}

Check their power, network connection, and source integration. This issue will disappear automatically when all entities become available again.

bypassed_sensors.description:
The alarm is armed, but these zones are temporarily bypassed because they were not closed:

{sensors}

Each zone will automatically return to active protection as soon as it reports `off`. A later change to `on` will then trigger the alarm normally.
